missing mathematics. Return the exact missing
implication or counterexample rather than adding
hypotheses, weakening the conclusion, or launching
research. Report the first meaningful compiler
feedback, checked declarations and builds,
translation evidence, semantic/non-vacuity/axiom
status, the consumer implication now available,
